  * Key code mechanism: BLIS StepTime() (trained_physics_model.go:154-331) includes sumCtx and MoE nEff terms that make per-request ITL grow sub-linearly with batch size, unlike the paper's linear W assumption. This is the hypothesized root cause of structural mismatch.

